FYI after a careful re-read of Ina's Deducer site it was clear one could install the latest version of R 2.15.2
THEN with the information Ian has supplied DL and install Deducer and set the deafults and now for me all is workign SUper.

Open R and enter:
install.packages(c("JGR","Deducer","DeducerExtras"))
library(JGR)
JGR()
GL

